      "content": "i get what youre saying but my doctor is always so rushed and i feel like he just dismisses me when i talk about supplements. i really dont want to wait weeks for an appointment just to ask about a vitamin/herb. if i just stick to a super low dose like 300mg once a day, do u think that would carry too much risk or would it probably just be fine? i really need something for my mood.",
